title: Example - TABLE word markers
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki;vocab=Default,Table

Live demo of the inline `TH` / `TD` markers from vocab/table. This tiddler's type field activates the vocabulary.

!! Rendered

TABLE
CAPTION Superheros and sidekicks
ROW
TH Power
TH Batman
TH Flash
--
ROW
TH Skill
TD Smarts
TD Super speed
--
ROW
TH Origin
TD Wayne Manor
TD Lab accident
--
---

!! Source

```
TABLE
CAPTION Superheros and sidekicks
ROW
TH Power
TH Batman
TH Flash
--
ROW
TH Skill
TD Smarts
TD Super speed
--
---
```

Each `TH`/`TD` (inline mode) consumes the rest of its line as the cell content, so one cell per line. `ROW` ends at `--`; `TABLE` ends at `---`.

See [[Customize a Table]] for the marker schema and the pragma-form alternative. For multi-paragraph cells use the block-mode variants in [[Example - TABLE with multiline cells]].
